// Checklist lessons (ticket 0456, docs/design/tutorial.md "The lessons"):
// the guide's box with a list of things to do, ticked as the player does
// them, in any order. The lesson closes when every item is ticked; while it
// is open the turn can't end (unless an item is `TurnEnded`). Each lesson
// shows once per campaign, the first time its trigger happens in a battle,
// one at a time.
//
// Fields:
//   id        snake_case; the campaign keeps it once the lesson is done.
//   level     Full (shows only at Full) or Short (at Full and Short).
//   trigger   what starts it: a tip trigger (tips.ron), e.g.
//             FirstBattleStart.
//   battles   optional: the battle ids it may start in (any if left out).
//   title     the heading, at most 30 characters.
//   text      1 or 2 lines of at most 60 characters.
//   items     1 to 6 of (label: "...", done_when: ...); a label is one line
//             of at most 56 characters. Two items can't share a done_when.
//   face      optional: the guide's expression, `smile` if left out.
//
// {Action} in text and labels is replaced with the key bound to that action
// (e.g. {Confirm}), {Cursor} with the keys that move the cursor, {Select}
// with the key that picks on the map, as in tips.ron.
//
// done_when: Pressed("<Action>") (the battle used that action, e.g.
// Pressed("CursorUp"), Pressed("Info"), Pressed("NextUnit")), UnitSelected,
// UnitMoved (where the unit goes was picked), ForecastOpened, Attacked,
// RewindOpened, TurnEnded.
//
// The lessons themselves are ticket 0457. The test lesson is in
// assets-test/data/lessons.ron.
(
    lessons: [],
)
